# Normalize line endings so the repo checks out identically on macOS and Windows.
#
# Git for Windows ships with core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites tracked text to
# CRLF on checkout. This repo tracks dist/ build output, so a Windows clone would
# otherwise produce artifacts that differ byte-for-byte from the macOS ones.
# Pinning eol=lf makes the working tree match the index on every platform,
# regardless of each machine's local git config.
* text=auto eol=lf